    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="6308a35b-0747-5665-a778-99a9bf7d1419" activityNameId="4be8e1fc-05ba-521f-a5d4-af6263dacb3f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Butyl acetate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Butyl acetate, at plant
The process "butyl acetate, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of butyl acetate from 1-butanol in Europe. Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with data from a similar process. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000141-78-6; 
Formula: C6H12O2; 
Synonyms: butyl ethanoate, n-butyl ester; 
UUID: b6aa048f-18eb-3c5d-84fa-ca87adc80b17
Production of butyl acetate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Esterification of 1-butanol
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b6aa048f-18eb-3c5d-84fa-ca87adc80b17.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
